      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#Process",
      "name": "A harness's default rendering",
      "summary": "Renders a harness instance as its default interface: its left-hand nav and docs on its own theme's art, and a board of its todos and beans from which a reader reads, reviews and, when a write tool is available, proposes changes into the publication review.",
      "description": "Renders a harness instance as its default interface: its left-hand nav and docs on its own theme's art, and a board of its todos and beans from which a reader reads, reviews and, when a write tool is available, proposes changes into the publication review.\n\nBean `folio-assistant-yj32`. The owner, 2026-09-20: \"LHS + docs/ = documentation pipeline rendering for ghpages/justthedocs + folio/miro like board for accessing and authoring/reviewing content, managing pipeline w/ todos/ beans/\". The page ground is the owner's card Q-DEP-2 A, 2026-11-01: the theme art goes behind every docs page.\n\nRead-only is the floor. Whether the reader may write is a question about the tools the session has (git-push, github-api, github-connector) and the reader's permissions, so the gateway reads capabilities and never assumes one write path. A change a reader proposes enters the content change review in folio-assistant-core (`content-change-review.bpmn`); this process enables that review and does not replace it.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "sourcePath": "processes/ui/harness-default-rendering.bpmn",
